# cursor-mcp inbox at chat start

This repo ships **`cursor_inbox`** — a filesystem message drop at `~/.cursor-mcp/inbox/` (override: `CURSOR_INBOX_DIR`).

At the **start of every Cursor chat** in this workspace:

1. Call `cursor_inbox` `operation=list` if the MCP tool is available.
2. Otherwise read unread JSON files in the inbox directory (not `acked/`).
3. Surface unread messages before other work; `ack` when handled.

See `src/cursor_mcp/tools/inbox.py` and `PRD.md` for schema and workflow.
